{"id":"flecha","lemma":"flecha","pos":"noun","rank":3457,"glosses":["arrow (projectile, symbol)"],"ipa":"/ˈflet͡ʃa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"flechas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ca/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-flecha.wav","examples":[{"text":"La flecha dio en el blanco.","en":"The arrow hit the target.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/67010","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"white"}]},{"text":"La flecha cayó cerca del objetivo.","en":"The arrow fell short of the target.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806214","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to fall","l":"caer"},{"g":"close"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"objective"}]},{"text":"Un arco sin flechas no vale para nada.","en":"A bow is no use without arrows.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581684","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"bow"},{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"a voucher"},null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"not at all"]]},{"text":"Un arco es inútil sin las flechas.","en":"A bow is no use without arrows.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589948","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"bow"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"useless, pointless"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Él le disparó una flecha al soldado.","en":"He shot an arrow at the soldier.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to shoot, to fire","l":"disparar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"soldier"}]}]}